* ASTRAN Technology Rules - gf180mcu 7-track (GlobalFoundries 180nm)
*
* Verified against primary LEF sources (gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu7t5v0, fetched
* 2026-10-09; see doc/RESEARCH_AND_OPTIMIZATION.md P1-8):
*   SITE GF018hv5v_mcu_sc7 0.56 x 3.92 = 7 tracks x 0.56 (routing grid 0.56)
*   met1: min width 0.230, min spacing 0.230 (0.300 when parallel >= 10um)
*   met2: min width 0.280, min spacing 0.280, pitch 0.56
*   supply VDD/VSS: Metal1 0.60 wide, centred on the row boundary
*   (ASTRAN supplysize 0.60 reproduces the straddle)
*   MFG grid 0.005; LEF DB 0.0005
*   stack: 3LM_1TM_30K -> 4 metal layers usable
* Rows not overridden below inherit tech_freePDK45 (GSCL45) values and are
* PLACEHOLDERS pending a gf180 DRC-deck run: the authoritative check for
* generated cells is the PDK's own deck, not ASTRAN's internal rules.

